{"id":"dfb578f78477d1b8","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-sl2-actions.md","title":"SL2 Actions","display":"df-sl2-actions — SL2 Actions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sl2-actions","aliases":["58-df-sl2-actions"],"display":"df-sl2-actions — SL2 Actions","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sl2-actions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sl2-actions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sl2-actions — SL2 Actions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,a,b,c,d,x,y,K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K\\in V\">\\(u,v,a,b,c,d,x,y,K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SLTwoPairAction}_S\\subseteq V^{13}\">\\(\\mathrm{SLTwoPairAction}_S\\subseteq V^{13}\\)</span> (representative-level action predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sl2\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SLTwoPairAction}_S(u,v,a,b,c,d,x,y,K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\n\\land a,b,c,d,x,y,u,v\\in K\n\\land(x\\neq0_K\\lor y\\neq0_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\cdot d=1_K+(b\\cdot c)\n\\land u=(a\\cdot x)+(b\\cdot y)\n\\land v=(c\\cdot x)+(d\\cdot y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sl2\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SLTwoPairAction}_S(u,v,a,b,c,d,x,y,K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\n\\land a,b,c,d,x,y,u,v\\in K\n\\land(x\\neq0_K\\lor y\\neq0_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\cdot d=1_K+(b\\cdot c)\n\\land u=(a\\cdot x)+(b\\cdot y)\n\\land v=(c\\cdot x)+(d\\cdot y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The determinant-one condition is written without an undeclared subtraction operation as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ad=1_K+bc\">\\(ad=1_K+bc\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This clause defines the action on nonzero coordinate representatives. Its compatibility with scalar equivalence, and hence the induced action on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P^1(K)\">\\(\\mathbb P^1(K)\\)</span>, is a downstream theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (field predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"u,v,a,b,c,d,x,y,K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SLTwoPairAction}_S\\subseteq V^{13}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sl2\\text{-}actions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SLTwoPairAction}_S(u,v,a,b,c,d,x,y,K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\n\\land a,b,c,d,x,y,u,v\\in K\n\\land(x\\neq0_K\\lor y\\neq0_K)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land a\\cdot d=1_K+(b\\cdot c)\n\\land u=(a\\cdot x)+(b\\cdot y)\n\\land v=(c\\cdot x)+(d\\cdot y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"ad=1_K+bc","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P^1(K)","display":false}],"bytes":1175,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sl2-actions.md|58-df-sl2-actions]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda"]}